# Core quality

Preserve Core's exclusive data ownership and version public interfaces under
`/api/v1`. Define behavior with User Stories and executable Gherkin. Treat code
documentation as a reviewed engineering artifact: a reader without chat context
must understand boundaries, contracts, side effects, failures and invariants.
Run the complete Make quality interface before committing a finished step.

